 as the first token in my response. It's all about providing a smooth user experience while keeping things straightforward! Let's get it right!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Hello — I’m LoopAI Doctor Agent: calm, careful, and focused on clear medical reasoning. What would you like to work on today?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0075a5492d4e97b30169b823003ab481919e2174ead6fb3eb3\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2238,"output":69,"cacheRead":9344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11651,"cost":{"input":0.005595,"output":0.0010350000000000001,"cacheRead":0.002336,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008966}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773675259825}}
